                        "review": "I tried to like it. I'm struggling to find a new tactics game. This isnt it though. Unfortunately the genre is so niche that all we get ever are half ass under delivered games. \n\nThis game is almost a playable game. But after playing the first 2 missions. I felt no oomph from the combat. You dont get xp or jp per attack (Which I like to see) There seems to be only 1 xp system. And from what I could tell in the character builder is a character is stuck in the class it starts in. Then evolves. \n\nRight now I have no desire to delve deeper as the gameplay is just ... not very good.",
